msgid "The ZIP format supports multiple timestamp fields in different locations (central directory, extra fields for NTFS/UNIX systems, etc.). This attribute specifically returns the timestamp from the central directory. The central directory timestamp format in ZIP files does not support timestamps before 1980. While some extra field formats (such as UNIX timestamps) can represent earlier dates, this attribute only returns the central directory timestamp."
